{
  "uid": "poc",
  "title": "PoC — commandes : synchrone, événementiel, hybride",
  "description": "Un passage = une option, un scénario, une répétition. Lien exact affiché par scripts/run.sh.",
  "tags": [
    "mgl870",
    "poc"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Passages",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(120, 120, 120, 0.4)",
        "target": {
          "type": "tags",
          "tags": [
            "run"
          ],
          "limit": 100,
          "matchAny": true
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "option",
        "label": "Option",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "A,B,C",
        "current": {
          "text": "A",
          "value": "A"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "A",
            "value": "A",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "B",
            "value": "B",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "C",
            "value": "C",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "scenario",
        "label": "Scénario",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(k6_http_reqs_total{option=\"$option\"}, scenario)",
          "refId": "scenario"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "name": "run",
        "label": "Passage",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(k6_http_reqs_total{option=\"$option\", scenario=\"$scenario\"}, testid)",
          "refId": "run"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Côté client (k6) — ce que voit le client",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Commandes envoyées et réponses par statut (/s)",
      "description": "H1, H2 — débit reçu par le client, par code HTTP. 201/402/409 (A, C) ou 202 (B) sont prévus ; 503 et 0 (délai dépassé) ne le sont pas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$run\", name=\"POST /orders\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latence d'acceptation (première réponse)",
      "description": "H1, H2, H7 · seuil R3 : p95 < 1 s — temps entre l’envoi de la commande et la première réponse HTTP, mesuré par k6. La ligne rouge marque 1 s.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMax": 1.2,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum (rate(k6_http_req_duration_seconds{testid=~\"$run\", name=\"POST /orders\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum (rate(k6_http_req_duration_seconds{testid=~\"$run\", name=\"POST /orders\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum (rate(k6_http_req_duration_seconds{testid=~\"$run\", name=\"POST /orders\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Réponses inattendues (%)",
      "description": "H1, H2 · seuil R2 : < 1 % — 5xx, délai dépassé ou erreur réseau, rapportés à toutes les réponses.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "axisSoftMax": 5,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$run\", name=\"POST /orders\", status!~\"201|202|402|409\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(k6_http_reqs_total{testid=~\"$run\", name=\"POST /orders\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "inattendues",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Utilisateurs virtuels k6 actifs",
      "description": "validité — si les VUs approchent de maxVUs, k6 devient le goulot et le passage n’est plus valide (skill campagne-mesures).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
